Use io, list, and string.

Define function count_byte taking text as a pointer to TcString, target as a byte returning a whole number:
    Let total start at 0.
    Let n be length of text.
    For every i from 0 as an unsigned number to n - 1:
        If text.data[i] equals target:
            Add 1 to total.
    Give back total.
Done.

Define function same_letters taking first as a pointer to TcString, second as a pointer to TcString returning a truth value:
    Let first length be length of first.
    Let second length be length of second.
    If first length isn't equal to second length:
        Give back false.
    For every i from 0 as an unsigned number to first length - 1:
        Let c be first.data[i].
        Let left count be count_byte(first, c).
        Let right count be count_byte(second, c).
        If left count isn't equal to right count:
            Give back false.
    Give back true.
Done.

Let first be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("eat"), bytes_len("eat")).
Let second be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("tea"), bytes_len("tea")).
Let third be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("tan"), bytes_len("tan")).
Let fourth be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("ate"), bytes_len("ate")).
Let fifth be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("nat"), bytes_len("nat")).
Let sixth be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("bat"), bytes_len("bat")).
Let words be an empty list of text.
push first to address of words.
push second to address of words.
push third to address of words.
push fourth to address of words.
push fifth to address of words.
push sixth to address of words.
Let n be count of words.
Let used be an empty list of whole numbers.
For every i from 0 as an unsigned number to n - 1:
    push 0 to address of used.

For every i from 0 as an unsigned number to n - 1:
    Let used_flag be list_get(address of used, i).
    If used_flag is 0:
        Define local word as TcString.
        word = list_get(address of words, i).
        Say address of word.
        list_set(address of used, i, 1).
        For every j from i + 1 as an unsigned number to n - 1:
            Let other_flag be list_get(address of used, j).
            If other_flag is 0:
                Define local other as TcString.
                other = list_get(address of words, j).
                If same_letters(address of word, address of other):
                    Say address of other.
                    list_set(address of used, j, 1).
        Say "---".

list_free(address of used).
list_free(address of words).
str_free(address of sixth).
str_free(address of fifth).
str_free(address of fourth).
str_free(address of third).
str_free(address of second).
str_free(address of first).
Return 0.
